# Generated by `nex compile` — LLVM IR text and native binaries live
# next to the source they were built from; never commit them.
examples/**/*.ll
examples/compile-hello/main

# Compiled example binaries (keep .nex sources, drop products)
examples/*/main
examples/**/main.ll

# Scala.js bundle for the docs playground is COMMITTED for now —
# the static-site deploy expects everything under docs/static/ to
# be present at build time, and there's no separate build step in
# the deploy pipeline yet. Rebuild with:
#   sbt nexJS/fullLinkJS
#   cp js/target/scala-3.8.3/nex-opt/main.js docs/static/nex-playground.js
# before pushing a commit that changes codegen / elaborator / parser
# (the bundle churns with those). When the docs deploy gains a
# pre-build sbt step, this can be re-added to .gitignore.
